msgid "What guests choose and agree to before they book."
msgstr "Ce que les clients choisissent et acceptent avant de réserver."

#: src/modules/Settings/sections/Website.jsx:440
msgid "Guests choose their room"
msgstr "Les clients choisissent leur chambre"

#: src/modules/Settings/sections/Website.jsx:444
msgid ""
"Guests pick the room number. When off, the first free room is given to them."
msgstr ""
"Les clients choisissent le numéro de chambre. Désactivé, la première chambre "
"libre leur est attribuée."

#: src/modules/Settings/sections/Website.jsx:453
